      {
        "text": "The true inheritance is only an empty shell. The possession Immortal Gu and those mortal Gu have already been taken. In Fang Yuan’s previous life, during the chaotic battle of the five regions, possession Immortal Gu was extremely well-known, and many high ranking Gu Immortals used it to extend lifespan. Although it is rank six, he treats it as a Gu that could change the structure of the world.",
